{"$id":"urn:gammaray:phase0:finding:draft-1","$schema":"https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema","additionalProperties":false,"allOf":[{"if":{"properties":{"identity_model":{"const":"occurrence"}}},"then":{"required":["occurrence_key"]}},{"if":{"properties":{"identity_model":{"const":"state"}}},"then":{"not":{"required":["occurrence_key"]}}},{"if":{"properties":{"status":{"const":"resolved"}}},"then":{"required":["resolved_at"]}}],"description":"A derived finding is not a normalized event. State findings use the identity model in D03 section 9.1; occurrence findings use section 9.2. The record is sensitive as a whole: it links rules and subjects inside a protected scope. Validate together with D03_FINDING_OBSERVATION.schema.json for observation records.","properties":{"finding_id":{"pattern":"^[0-9a-f]{64}$","type":"string"},"first_seen":{"format":"date-time","type":"string"},"identity_model":{"enum":["state","occurrence"]},"identity_version":{"const":2},"last_seen":{"format":"date-time","type":"string"},"latest_observation_id":{"pattern":"^[0-9a-f]{64}$","type":"string"},"observation_count":{"minimum":1,"type":"integer"},"occurrence_key":{"maxLength":512,"minLength":1,"pattern":"^\\S+$","type":"string"},"resolved_at":{"format":"date-time","type":"string"},"rule_id":{"maxLength":128,"minLength":1,"pattern":"^[A-Za-z0-9][A-Za-z0-9_.:-]*$","type":"string"},"scope_id":{"maxLength":128,"minLength":1,"pattern":"^[A-Za-z0-9][A-Za-z0-9_.:-]*$","type":"string"},"status":{"enum":["open","resolved","reopened","unknown"]},"subject_id":{"maxLength":512,"minLength":1,"pattern":"^[A-Za-z0-9._@~-]+(:[A-Za-z0-9._@~-]+)*$","type":"string"},"superseded_by":{"pattern":"^[0-9a-f]{64}$","type":"string"},"supersedes":{"pattern":"^[0-9a-f]{64}$","type":"string"}},"required":["finding_id","identity_model","identity_version","scope_id","rule_id","subject_id","status","first_seen","last_seen","observation_count"],"title":"GammaRay derived finding record (PROPOSED, task P0-D03-002)","typ